==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], Backhoe Cat, [[Driller Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Driller Cat]], [[Piledriver Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Piledriver Cat]], [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]] and [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Miter Saw Cat]] could only be unlocked when "Grandon Mining Corps" was part of the current pool.
*The backhoe's bucket resembles a cat's face.
**Unlike traditional backhoes, the bucket on the cat closes from both the top and the bottom.
*Backhoe Cat could be seen in [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Subterra Guardians]]' attack animation before he was added, albeit with a darker color scheme, a second cat inside the backhoe, and the number "04" instead of "09".
**In the Ultra Form, [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Subterra Saviours]], a conceptual Ultra Form design for Backhoe Cat, along with all other Grandon Mining Corps units can be seen during its attack animation. They have the same color scheme of all other [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] Ultra Forms, that being red and black with gold lining.
*He is currently the only non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] unit to have the Attacks Only ability.
*The Attacks Only ability doesn't carry over to Neo Backhoe Cat's [[Surge Attack]], meaning that it can damage non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies.

